{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650780/extras/Key.png?t=1749063629\" /><strong>Cavern is a Roguelike Sandbox  with\u00a0RPG  elements!</strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650780/extras/Key.png?t=1749063629\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Every situation presents a unique challenge and a unique solution whether you decide to fight or meddle. Each character has the ability to swap out objects in the game at will, along with unique characteristics. As you go deeper into the Cavern, the level generation becomes more chaotic, and you will gain more control... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650780/extras/swapping.gif?t=1749063629\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Swap a rock into a bomb to clear terrain,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Swap a harmless pot into a slime to fight on your side,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Swap a skeleton's sword into a useless stick,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">or swap cobwebs into shiny gems to distract an enemy,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">the choice is yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650780/extras/Bomb.png?t=1749063629\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650780/extras/Rock.png?t=1749063629\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650780/extras/Pot.png?t=1749063629\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features - Currently In Development</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650780/extras/Spike.png?t=1749063629\" />\u00a0Unique Swapping Mechanic that turns every run into a sandbox</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650780/extras/Modem.png?t=1749063629\" />Anomaly System that changes the game as you play, presenting you with fresh challenges and unique opportunities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650780/extras/GemWall.png?t=1749063629\" />\u00a0Procedurally Generated Levels with Seeding Support</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650780/extras/UpgradeChest.png?t=1749063629\" />\u00a0Artifacts that enhance or mutate your strategy per run</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650780/extras/BloodCell.png?t=1749063629\" />\u00a0Perma-Death </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650780/extras/Topaz.png?t=1749063629\" />\u00a0Specialized Characters with unique move sets and abilities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650780/extras/LargeFormation.png?t=1749063629\" />\u00a0Challenging Bosses &amp; Enemies  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650780/extras/Slime.png?t=1749063629\" />\u00a0A Humorous Narrative with Epic Cutscenes that will pull at your Heart Strings </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650780/extras/Nut.png?t=1749063629\" />\u00a0swag</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2650780?t=1749063629","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.ste